OL,3,AIsrael heads to polls for pivotal
OL,4,Aelection defined by security and
OL,5,Ademocracy
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraelis are heading to the polls for
OL,8,Fwhat many view as one of the most
OL,9,Fpivotal elections in the country's
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FPolling published on Friday suggests
OL,13,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is in a
OL,14,Fnear neck-and-neck race with former
OL,15,Fmilitary chief Gadi Eisenkot to become
OL,16,Fprime minister.
OL,18,FBut neither of their political blocs
OL,19,Fare projected to win the 61 seats
OL,20,Fneeded to form a majority government -
OL,21,Fmeaning weeks or months of political
OL,22,Fwrangling may lie ahead.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
