OL,3,AIsrael heads to polls for pivotal
OL,4,Aelection defined by security and
OL,5,Ademocracy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe campaign has been shaped by the
OL,8,Fissue of security - with the opposition
OL,9,Fbloc hammering Netanyahu for the
OL,10,Funprecedented security failure that led
OL,11,Fto the 7 October Hamas-led attacks on
OL,12,FIsrael, in which nearly 1,200 people
OL,13,Fwere killed and 251 taken back to Gaza
OL,14,Fas hostages.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
